    "description": "HOTWORX is an infrared sauna exercise studio open 24/7, 365 days a year! With their unique infrared workouts, you can torch calories and have fun doing it when it fits your schedule! HOTWORX allows you to work out with friends and offers a quick and effective workout routine. If your number one fitness goal is toning, visit HOTWORX in Gulf Shores! Find us in the Publix Shopping Center on Cotton Creek Drive and see how you can get started with HOTWORX today! more workout, less time! 24-hour Access to Virtually Instructed Infrared Sauna Workouts and Functional Exercise Zone. Are you someone who is motivated by excitement, joy, and a love for exercise? Do you love spending time with your family but still want a quick and effective workout routine? HOTWORX might be the perfect workout routine for you!",
